  <comment view="class">Client — an example XML Schema (client.xsd), converted into AI Designer models.

A client-onboarding record. A Client has one main client and any number of related clients; both extend a shared ClientDetailsType (name, ID number, a legal entity and a list of documents), and a related client adds its relationship details and role. Names and codes are enumerations. Small and self-contained — a good first look at inheritance, nesting and optional parts.

Source: https://github.com/mganss/XmlSchemaClassGenerator/blob/master/XmlSchemaClassGenerator.Tests/xsd/client/client.xsd
From the test suite of XmlSchemaClassGenerator (Apache License 2.0).</comment>
